# Scientific plots (Streamlit)

Full playbook: `docs/AI-deployment/TASK_PLAYBOOKS/11_scientific_plots_ux.md`.

- Plot first; put dense controls in a **collapsed** expander below the chart.
- **Invert X** must not reset axis ranges or trace visibility.
- Seed axis ranges once (`*_ranges_initialized`); Y bounds from **all** series on fit/reset.
- Prefer metrics cards + dataframes; do not show raw JSON next to the same data.
- Graph export (PNG/JPEG/TIFF, inches + DPI) lives in Plot settings via `plot_export.py`.
- Preview vs Apply for baseline/denoise-style steps.
- Parameter ❔ helpers for non-obvious options.
- Never nest peak/list editors under one-shot `if pending_*` branches.
